{"meta":{"id":"tt13098590","type":"movie","name":"Terror en el rio","imdb_id":"tt13098590","description":"Australia, 1946. Cuando una banda de despiadados delincuentes pierde el oro robado al hundirse su coche en un río, recurren a un equipo de buceadores desesperados y sin suerte para recuperarlo. Lo que comienza como una misión de recuperación de alto riesgo se complica cuando los buceadores se encuentran con un feroz tiburón toro... pero los peligros en las profundidades del agua son sólo una fracción de los que les esperan arriba.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt13098590.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hr3yzjzfsiNxWqlDgRTSHgYB7fz.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bpfVYcVbXnu5hcxtGy2p8DACIyk.png","genres":["Terror","Acción","Aventura","Suspense"],"releaseInfo":"2025","released":"2025-05-02T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"85 min","imdbRating":"5.1","country":"Australia","cast":["Hermione Corfield","Jake Ryan","Josh McConville","Kevin Dee","Clayton Watson","Sam Parsonson","Jacob Junior Nayinggul","Arthur Angel","Maximillian Johnson","Will Fletcher","Tom Beaurepaire"],"director":["Matthew Holmes"],"writer":["Gregory Moss","Matthew Holmes"],"trailers":[{"source":"-OnUk2ITg_w","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"-OnUk2ITg_w","lang":"en"},{"source":"852xyIzkCf0","type":"Trailer","name":"UK Trailer","ytId":"852xyIzkCf0","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"-OnUk2ITg_w","title":"Official Trailer"},{"ytId":"852xyIzkCf0","title":"UK Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"5.1","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt13098590"},{"name":"Terror","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/movie/top?genre=Terror"},{"name":"Acción","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/movie/top?genre=Acci%C3%B3n"},{"name":"Aventura","category":"Genres","url":"